MobileGlues offers OpenGL 4.1 instead of 4.0, still with 4.0's features. Factorio's demo (2.1.23) asks for a 4.1 context
and stops when it can't have one ("4.1 was requested but customGLVersion is 4.0"); the full game asks for less and plays
the same either way (Xiaomi 12T, Mali-G610: demo main menu at 60 FPS, a full 2.1.24 save at 57-60 FPS).

